# Banter in Hartsblight Forest (story/banter.gd plays this file only where a place's region is hartsblight_forest): one exchange between two or three companions about what is in
# front of them in one place, gated on that place (`at:`) and on the story's state so a remark never runs ahead of the chapter. Played now and then on entering
# an area, once each; an exchange nobody present can speak comes out empty and is skipped.
# Drafted by Gemini (docs/plans/gemini_companions/), edited; every edit is listed in the README there. Lines are unvoiced until the voice lane reads them.


~ hb_pine_barrens_01_rook_lucan
if name:rook_coldwake and name:lucan_houndstooth and at:hb_pine_barrens and not flag.gorthos_slain
interject name:rook_coldwake: Mind your step, Lucan. Rusted iron under the needles and not a warning posted.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: A trapper's stamp on the jaw. Poor craft, worse concealment, and a dreadful spring.
interject name:rook_coldwake: Your hound's at that pine with the empty leash round it. Call him back before he finds the hardware.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: Come back to my boots, Barnaby. Someone left their dog behind a long time ago.
endif
-> END

~ hb_infested_outcrop_02_tobin_silas
if name:tobin_hayward and name:silas_vane and at:hb_infested_outcrop and not flag.gorthos_slain
interject name:tobin_hayward: Every beetle in the parish is chewing at this outcrop, Silas, and not one crosses the smoke.
interject name:silas_vane: That hissing bottle's still paying out protection, though the poor sods on the log folded early.
interject name:tobin_hayward: That trench is scored with acid. At least there's no spark in the pit.
interject name:silas_vane: I'll walk the rim between you and the fire pit. Just don't ask me to take the dead man's boots.
endif
-> END

~ hb_noxious_hollow_03_delphine_cordelia
if name:delphine_ravelle and name:cordelia_skein and at:hb_noxious_hollow and not flag.gorthos_slain
interject name:delphine_ravelle: White-green mould from root to canopy, Cordelia. Not one clean spot to rest a hem.
interject name:cordelia_skein: Look how the shelf fungus splits the bark along the grain. You can hear my eyes clicking.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Your Foolishness is pulling faces at that torn pack. Whatever's inside is rotten or half-eaten.
interject name:cordelia_skein: Leave the journal to me. Whatever opened him up had very poor table manners.
endif
-> END

~ hb_patient_commune_04_rook_delphine
if name:rook_coldwake and name:delphine_ravelle and at:hb_patient_commune and not flag.gorthos_slain
interject name:rook_coldwake: Eighteen still in the grass, Delphine, and not a stone over one of them. Even the well's gone white.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: The spores come down like cheap paper snow. And that drumming in the trees has no rhythm at all.
interject name:rook_coldwake: Look at those four under one blanket. Tucked in together before the rot came.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Don't look at the little ones, Rook. Even the sunflowers have their heads down tonight.
endif
-> END

~ hb_druid_commune_05_rook_cordelia
if name:rook_coldwake and name:cordelia_skein and at:hb_druid_commune and not flag.gorthos_slain
interject name:rook_coldwake: Homes dug out of rotten trunks, Cordelia, and no drainage on the whole common.
interject name:cordelia_skein: The spores here would coat your lungs, if you used them. You've forgotten to breathe again.
interject name:rook_coldwake: Much obliged. I'll log the sigh once we're past the drums.
interject name:cordelia_skein: And antler idols set out with surprising symmetry. Keep your ledger dry under that shield.
endif
-> END

~ hb_altar_of_rot_06_delphine_tobin
if name:delphine_ravelle and name:tobin_hayward and at:hb_altar_of_rot and not flag.hb_effigy_burned
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Now that's stagecraft, Tobin. A towering branch lady and a house full of little stick extras.
interject name:tobin_hayward: You don't look a blight in the eye when you're made of dry twigs. Tight weave on her ribs, though.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Your Foolishness says the stag is waiting for an encore. Look, its head's turned like it still hears hounds.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Nobody brings a match near this glade while I'm stood in it.
endif
-> END

~ hb_wellspring_07_lucan_tobin
if name:lucan_houndstooth and name:tobin_hayward and at:hb_wellspring and not flag.gorthos_slain
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: Good heavens. A ceiling of live fungus and a river the colour of tallow.
interject name:tobin_hayward: The root of this whole valley is soured down to that pool. Those stones lean like rotten teeth.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: That glowing growth on the bank smells of boiled turnip. Points off. Barnaby keeps well behind me.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Keep the little lad off the wet moss. That water would blister a hound's pads clean off.
endif
-> END

~ hb_druid_commune_08_cordelia_tobin
if name:cordelia_skein and name:tobin_hayward and at:hb_druid_commune and flag.gorthos_slain
interject name:cordelia_skein: The spores have halved since Gorthos fell, Tobin. My thread hangs straight in the air again.
interject name:tobin_hayward: The drumming's done, and the rot's stopped creeping for an hour. Still smells of sour bedding.
interject name:cordelia_skein: Your pulse is steadier, darling, and your primrose has opened a fraction.
interject name:tobin_hayward: Keep your vials to yourself. Let these poor trees sit quiet without us poking at them.
endif
-> END
